    "description": "<p>The perfect defensive technique of the Dragon-Blood becomes a shield for all those near her. This Charm permanently improves the Exalt's ability to protect those around her in mass combat. When the Dragon-Blood successfully defends against an attack targeting her unit (achieves a successful defense roll), she may simultaneously apply half her defense successes (round down) as a bonus to the unit's DV against the next attack made against it before the beginning of her next action. Multiple Dragon-Bloods with this Charm and Cooperative keyword can pool their defensive successes in the same scene.</p>",
